    "turn_text": "Well, I bring up Reagan for one reason. Reagan was cognitive the entire time. He was funny. He would tell great stories. And in fact, one of those famous debates with Mondale, the moderator brings up age and Mondale says, yes, it's certainly going to be a problem. And Reagan says, I'm not going to hold his youth in inexperience against them,",
